# zcashflow
===
 Free, open-source personal finance app for Windows, macOS, Linux, Android & iPhone. Track spending, scan receipts with on-device OCR, plan bills, debts, savings goals and budgets, and see a month-end forecast. No cloud, no account – devices sync end-to-end encrypted over your own Wi-Fi..
